### Retrieve all employees
GET http://localhost:6161/employee-api/employee

### Register a new employee
POST http://localhost:6161/employee-api/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe",
    "email": "john.doe@example.com",
    "mobile": "1234567890",
    "designation": "Software Engineer",
    "companyName": "Tech Company"
}

### Update an employee's details
PUT http://localhost:6161/employee-api/employee
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "John Doe Updated",
    "email": "john.de@example.com",
    "mobile": "1234567890",
    "designation": "Senior Software Engineer",
    "companyName": "Tech Company"
}

### Delete an employee
DELETE http://localhost:6161/employee-api/employee/john.de@example.com